X:377
T:O What My Bomey Graney Was. JBut.375
T:What a Beau My Granny Was,aka. JBut.375
N:The title appears to be  a corruption of "What A Beaux My Granny Was"
N:This, and close variations, is the title of a  tune in  4/4 found in a number
N:of 18thC/19thC tune books, including Aird's Airs, Vol.4, 16, p.6
