L:1/8
N:The title of this tune is a line from Robert Burns "When Wild Wars Deadly Blast".
N:The tune has similarities to The Mill, Mill o, AKA, The Soldier's Return.
N:This is the tune Burns suggested that the poem be sung to. https://thesession.org/tunes/14436.
N:I have attempted to make a playable tune, but my working must be viewed with the scepticism
N:that any conjectural re-working deserves.
