X:1009
T:Jessey the Flower of Dunn Blane. JBut.1004
T:Jessie the Flower O' Dunblane. JBut.1004
B:John Buttrey MS, poss. Lincolnshire, early 19thC
S:https://buttreymilitarysocialtunes1800.wordpress.com/
Z:vmp.2019.Greg Bradfield-Smith.
N:Lyrics were set to this tune and published by Robert Tannahill (The Paisley born weavwer)
N:in 1808 as "Jessie The Flower O' Dunblane"
N:The tune as notated in the Buttrey MS contains some anomalies and unidentified symbols.
